        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "",
            "step_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+to+Replace+Broken+Deck+Boards+on+an+Outdoor+Patio/<#s273314>",
            "instructions": [
                "Check and sweep the joists.",
                "In most cases, deck framing typically takes a lot longer to deteriorate because it is protected from the sun, wind, and rain by the boards above it. So joists should be in good shape."
            ],
            "images": [],
            "edit_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+to+Replace+Broken+Deck+Boards+on+an+Outdoor+Patio/</Guide/edit/137262/273314>",
